+// GENERATED by scripts/build-airframe-glyph.mjs from docs/security-2525/xbat-wireframe/xbat.wire.json.
+// Do not hand-edit. `node scripts/build-airframe-glyph.mjs --check` (in test:ci) refuses a stale copy.
+//
+// THE REAL AIRFRAME CANNOT BE IN THE SKY FORTY-TWO TIMES. It is 901 vertices and 1755
+// edges; forty-two of it is about 74,000 edges against a ceiling
+// of 4,000. So what flies is a SILHOUETTE of it, proportioned from the airframe's own extent — length
+// 38.579 m, span 8.628 m, height 26.2 m — normalised to a nose-forward unit of length 1 and
+// scaled at draw time. Generated from the airframe so the two can never drift apart.
+//
+// Body coordinates: forward +x, right +y, up +z.
